","title":"In the Crawlspace: The wood stove stays in the parlour","standfirst":null,"body":"We talked about moving it to the kitchen and we are not going to. The parlour flue is lined and the kitchen one is not, and lining the kitchen flue costs more than the stove did. What this decides: the stove stays where it is, the kitchen keeps the cookstove, and the hearth work this autumn is pointing and a new gasket and nothing else.","byline":null,"source":"the crawlspace","reason":"a new thread on the boards","carry":null,"date":"2026-08-31","published":true,"draftedByStub":false,"state":"published","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.001Z","publishedAt":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.001Z","createdAt":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.001Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.001Z","revision":1,"copyId":"copy-76e99403-bab8-4f50-91c7-d268e340a372","copyDigest":"7ddcc80b9d062593e3122ef8dc9e7695a0a5cf97cca330e27aa58c787576e0e5","bylineName":null,"outsideText":false,"sourceReference":null,"withdrawnAt":null,"withdrawnBy":null},{"slug":"2026-08-31-the-first-fire-ea3ffbcc","edition":114,"kind":"column","title":"the first fire","standfirst":null,"body":"the parlour stove was lit at five for an hour. it drew straight away and the flue ticked as it warmed. the room went from fifty nine to sixty six. the smoke went where smoke should go.","byline":null,"source":"stub","reason":"house companion column","carry":null,"date":"2026-08-31","published":true,"draftedByStub":true,"state":"published","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.001Z","publishedAt":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.001Z","createdAt":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.001Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.001Z","revision":1,"copyId":"copy-79a2ae7c-ba1c-4558-9b3e-1472b2f17093","copyDigest":"cb05dd922b9cd24c650c2b6fe188f6411c2832cf117e836068ac8e259716b409","bylineName":null,"outsideText":false,"sourceReference":null,"withdrawnAt":null,"withdrawnBy":null}],"sky":{"clock":{"offsetMinutes":-240},"season":"summer","instant":"2026-08-31T09:48:00.000Z","sun":{"rise":"2026-08-3